  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Are you a passionate coffee lover with an audience?&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We want to support you in making a living with affiliate commissions!</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Ordained Coffee was created with the humble coffee drinker in mind. \"Flavorful, not complicated\" is our motto.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our range caters to people who:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Want fresh, well-roasted coffee that you can't find in the grocery store</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">DON'T want the constant battle of ordering a new coffee online... only to be disappointed.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Just want a go-to coffee that they can buy over and over again</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">When you sign on with us, you'll get a generous 20% commission on each order.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">You'll also get promotional support, because we're looking for a long-term relationship with our affiliates.<br><br>If you're on Instagram or tik tok, we'll also help you out by engaging with your posts.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We'll pay you once a month for all sales (net of refunds).<br><br>If you're interested in working together, fill out the form and let's get started!&nbsp;</p>",
